                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Attention Medicare Beneficiaries!\n\nMedicare\u2019s Annual Enrollment Period (AEP) runs from October 15 through December 7.\n\nIn response to federal regulations, many Medicare Advantage plans will be changing core or supplemental benefits, raising rates, and in some cases exiting local markets.\n\nPlease read your Annual Notice of Change letter carefully and review your Medicare Advantage and Part D plan coverage options to see if there\u2019s a better match for your personal needs and finances.\n\nNeed assistance? Help from Medicare is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, except some federal holidays.\n\n\u2022 1-800-MEDICARE (1-800-633-4227)\n\u2022 TTY users can call 1-877-486-2048",
