                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The bill fully funds rebuilding the Francis Scott Key Bridge.\nA man-made accident caused the collapse and taxpayers are now on the hook for billions of dollars?\n\nThe company at fault\u2013and their insurance\u2013should be paying for this. Not the American taxpayer. https://t.co/6wSuNBb3Md",
