                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 17,
                "retweet_count": 29,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Veterans earned quality and timely healthcare.\n\nNo more hung-up phone calls. No more waiting until it\u2019s too late. No more lives lost because they\u2019re ignored.\n\nMy bill, the Veterans True Choice Act, gives our veterans immediate options when it comes to their healthcare. It gives service-connected disabled veterans the ability to continue using the VA or allow them to access private healthcare providers through TRICARE Select or TRICARE for Life.\n\nThank you, @HouseVetAffairs for holding a hearing on this life changing legislation. My fellow veterans and I are eager to get this bill across the finish line.",
