                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare\u2019s restrictions prevent seniors from accessing the full scope of chiropractic care\u2014services often covered by private insurance and the VA.\n\nThe Chiropractic Medicare Coverage Modernization Act expands coverage, offering non-drug alternatives to pain management and will help to reduce reliance on opioids.\n\nI\u2019m glad to join @RepJohnLarson, @SenKevinCramer and @SenBlumenthal, in this bipartisan effort to prioritize seniors\u2019 health and treatment options.\n\nhttps://t.co/sNft657oZT",
