                "retweet_count": 26,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump has called for one bold reconciliation bill to deliver the America First agenda\u2014no piecemeal deals.\u00a0\n\nHouse Republicans are ready to secure the border, cut taxes, and protect Social Security and Medicare. That means no tax on tips, making TCJA permanent, and real relief for working Americans!",
