                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "After @DOGE discovered over 12 million \u201c120+ year-olds\u201d still on the federal rolls, I reintroduced the Valid Benefits Act. \n\nSeniors who\u2019ve paid into Social Security and Medicare their entire lives deserve better than Washington waste. \n\nIt\u2019s time to clean this mess up and make sure not a single penny is lost to fraud or bureaucratic failure.\n\nhttps://t.co/XBeKM4rpsr",
